{"format":1,"product":"exileds-gateway","channel":"dev","version":"0.1.5-dev.2","platform":"windows-x86_64","git_commit":"2b0fb70420b6c74dc8b22d53f02be8145d321d31","protocol_version":73,"data_hash_format":10,"base_data_hash":"5ccda1584ed50ce0b29dd074a77357d5bb71f44d3864c5a021db0aa470d654fc","min_launcher_version":"0.0.0","notes":"# eXiled's Gateway 0.1.5-dev.2\n\nThis is a dev-channel pre-release for testing. It may have rough edges.\n\nRealms: after a realm upgrades its lobby (lobby protocol 8), joining it needs dev.2 or newer. dev.1 launchers are\ntold to update.\n\nLauncher:\n\n- The six built-in themes now ship with their background, banner and frame art. Art you put in your own app data\n  still takes priority.\n- The Characters tab shows each character's play time.\n- Realms can show a region in the server list.\n\nGame:\n\n- Player melee damage now includes the strength and dexterity weapon bonus, and item enhanced damage that raises\n  only maximum damage. Damage now matches the original game on the tested gear (it was about a third too low).\n- Quill rat spikes now deal the original game's damage, using a fixed missile level per difficulty.\n- Mercenaries get experience for kills of raised monsters as in the original game.\n- Saves keep durability, mercenary life and play time.\n\nGraphics (HD):\n\n- Dungeons are darker, close to the original game: lower ambient light, stronger torch light and softer shine.\n  Act 4 keeps its old lighting. To go back to the old look, set RIFT_HD_AMBIENT_SCALE=1, RIFT_HD_POINT_PEAK=0.55\n  and RIFT_HD_SPEC_SCALE=1.\n- Walking between connected outdoor areas keeps the ground and rivers loaded instead of rebuilding them.\n- Faster HD scenes and terrain texture loading.\n\nOnline:\n\n- Lobby protocol 8: host regions, and a host can no longer be booked for more games than it has room for.\n\nReplays: replays recorded before this version from games with real gear no longer verify, because damage changed.\n","files":[{"path":"OFL.txt","size":4383,"sha256":"f2b3029aba64c378bf0963b62945eee15e564fe4330b934c8f2eb058282b5e83","url":"https://github.com/Devz952/exileds-gateway-releases/releases/download/v0.1.5-dev.2/OFL.txt"},{"path":"README.txt","size":646,"sha256":"f76574bfef699e24fe5d0d2379ec578c77ff2eeb4ee5e1c791876dfa33f076b0","url":"https://github.com/Devz952/exileds-gateway-releases/releases/download/v0.1.5-dev.2/README.txt"},{"path":"assets/launcher/icon/icon.jpg","size":29804,"sha256":"44c919d0ebeefaad34b7e90acb8d88a77a56a8e03d92a85caec4e96112a31702","url":"https://github.com/Devz952/exileds-gateway-releases/releases/download/v0.1.5-dev.2/assets.launcher.icon.icon.jpg"},{"path":"assets/themes/blight/background.jpg","size":238145,"sha256":"8b5594fabff8b0f8e08c4a95e59c87ff0d92780dce4d2aa3f8b279650d4f4a51","url":"https://github.com/Devz952/exileds-gateway-releases/releases/download/v0.1.5-dev.2/assets.themes.blight.background.jpg"},{"path":"assets/themes/blight/banner.png","size":1084806,"sha256":"cad539cbf6864a02a98cd0793807d2ec1be479c22399f2843ca0724f1ac5ac14","url":"https://github.com/Devz952/exileds-gateway-releases/releases/download/v0.1.5-dev.2/assets.themes.blight.banner.png"},{"path":"assets/themes/blight/panel_frame.png","size":300246,"sha256":"b0fa717145722de72f39598b0ab67fc93e4a1f8e574450a5997f890336876761","url":"https://github.com/Devz952/exileds-gateway-releases/releases/download/v0.1.5-dev.2/assets.themes.blight.panel_frame.png"},{"path":"assets/themes/blight/play_frame.png","size":23792,"sha256":"300dd8c7e14f1ee2fe2d0f9d86010bde8c39cea5a4bc7d5ea84d4140186f9f66","url":"https://github.com/Devz952/exileds-gateway-releases/releases/download/v0.1.5-dev.2/assets.themes.blight.play_frame.png"},{"path":"assets/themes/blight/sidebar_art.jpg","size":216555,"sha256":"5c9f48febee910eaf96d7cbb8d6a4af0e44ae6c384d16f475c79bcdeeab42193","url":"https://github.com/Devz952/exileds-gateway-releases/releases/download/v0.1.5-dev.2/assets.themes.blight.sidebar_art.jpg"},{"path":"assets/themes/blight